# mutgap_tex_shared_dual_plane_cube: A two-plane Depth32Float_Stencil8 shared texture backing (type 18) in task 0 that is one cube of 4x4 faces, used from task 1 through a type 16 texture. Paging goes over faces 0-5 only: the guest bytes after the sixth face of each plane (a 0xEE sentinel) are never read or written. Face 5's two planes copy out as the guest wrote them; new stencil bytes copied into face 5 with invalidateGuest only, then 53 on task 0, page out, and the sentinels stay. Host-keyed: whether Metal makes a shareable depth-stencil cube is the host's.
